ginal resource profiles with practical uses, dated pricing evidence, privacy limitations and independent learning exercises. Unresolved chart identities stay visible.</p><a href="/ai/services">Explore the service directory →</a></article><article class="card"><p class="meta">LOCAL CALCULATOR / DATED RATE PRESETS</p><h3>What does your subscription deliver?</h3><p>Count token categories, accepted work and human review. Keep API-equivalent estimates apart from allowances, credits and savings.</p><a href="/ai/value">Read the analysis and try the calculator →</a></article></div></section><section class="prose"><h2>The existing stack, in context.</h2><p><a href="/ai-stack">AI stack</a> retains its own dated tool choices and attribution. <a href="/ai-income">AI and work</a> is a separate existing guide. Check each page’s date before treating its observations as a current product recommendation.</p></section><footer>PointCast Editorial Desk · Prepared with Codex from sourced research. October 5, 2026. Facts, interpretation and proposals are distinguished throughout.</footer></main>
